OL,3,GNEWSATube drivers set to begin to      
OL,4,Astrike over changes                    
OL,6,FTube drivers are due to walk out from  
OL,7,Fmidday in the first of eight planned   
OL,8,Fstrikes, with disruption expected      
OL,9,Facross the London Underground.         
OL,11,FMembers of the RMT union will go on    
OL,12,Fstrike until 11:59 GMT on Friday in a  
OL,13,Frow over proposed changes to their     
OL,14,Fworking patterns.                      
