OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATube drivers set to begin to      
OL,4,Astrike over changes                    
OL,6,FTransport for London (TfL) said there  
OL,7,Fwill be no service on the Piccadilly   
OL,8,Fand Circle lines all day on Thursday,  
OL,9,Fwhile the Waterloo & City line will    
OL,10,Fclose from midday. All other lines are 
OL,11,Fexpected to run a reduced service from 
OL,12,F10:00, with disruption from midday. No 
OL,13,FTube trains will run anywhere on the   
OL,14,Fnetwork after 21:00.                   
OL,16,FOn Friday, all lines will start late   
OL,17,Fand disruption could last until about  
OL,18,F18:00.                                 
